Q. in prod env which is the best method to do blue & green deployment in eks ingress level or service level ? consider of hpa also 
for blue we need to write separate yaml & for green separate yaml ?
--> 👉 Ingress-level Blue–Green is the BEST approach for production EKS
👉 Especially when HPA is used
👉 Yes, Blue and Green must have separate Deployments and separate HPAs
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Deployment: myapp-blue
Deployment: myapp-green

HPA: myapp-blue-hpa
HPA: myapp-green-hpa

Service:
- myapp-blue-svc
- myapp-green-svc

Ingress:
- routes traffic to blue or green
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
